# Frontend Component Patterns

## Component Architecture

### Component Hierarchy
- **Pages**: Top-level route components in `resources/js/pages/`
- **Layouts**: Shared layout components in `resources/js/layouts/`
- **Components**: Reusable UI components in `resources/js/components/`
- **Hooks**: Custom logic hooks in `resources/js/hooks/`
- **Utils**: Utility functions in `resources/js/lib/`

```tsx
// Good: Clear component hierarchy
// pages/courses/index.tsx
import { CourseGrid } from '@/components/course-grid';
import { CourseFilters } from '@/components/course-filters';
import { MainLayout } from '@/layouts/main';

const CourseIndex: React.FC<CourseIndexProps> = ({ courses, filters }) => {
  return (
    <MainLayout>
      <CourseFilters filters={filters} />
      <CourseGrid courses={courses} />
    </MainLayout>
  );
};
```

